  "description": "Per-user activity tracking for ASP.NET Core on OpenTelemetry. Links every request, page view, click and data change to the signed-in user so you can follow a user's journey in Application Insights or any OpenTelemetry backend. Includes an endpoint for browser apps (React and other SPAs) and never captures form values or query strings.",
